            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>SodaTide works through a combination of prebiotic fiber, resistant starch, and probiotics, with the overall goal of supporting a balanced intestinal environment. The prebiotic ingredients provide nourishment that beneficial gut microorganisms can use, while the probiotic component supplies selected beneficial microorganisms. Together, these components are intended to complement normal digestive function and microbiome balance. This is a different approach from stimulant-based products that attempt to increase energy or suppress appetite through stimulating ingredients. SodaTide instead focuses on nutritional support for the digestive ecosystem.</div><div><br></div><div>The first part of the process involves Chicory Root Inulin. As a prebiotic fiber, inulin is not fully digested in the upper digestive tract. It can reach the colon and become a food source for certain beneficial microorganisms. Supporting these microorganisms may help maintain a healthier balance within the gut microbiome. The amount of benefit a person experiences can vary depending on their existing diet, gut microbiota, and overall health. For this reason, SodaTide should be viewed as a supportive part of a broader wellness routine rather than a product that produces identical results for everyone.</div><div><br></div><div>The second part involves Potato Resistant Starch. Resistant starch passes through the small intestine to a greater extent than ordinary digestible starch. Once it reaches the colon, gut microorganisms can ferment it. This process contributes to the production of compounds that are part of normal microbial metabolism. By including resistant starch alongside inulin, SodaTide provides more than one type of prebiotic substrate for the gut environment. This combination supports the product's overall focus on digestive and metabolic wellness rather than relying on a single ingredient.</div><div><br></div><div>The third part is the probiotic component. Probiotics are microorganisms that are included in many digestive-health products because they can help support a balanced intestinal environment. SodaTide combines its probiotic blend with prebiotic ingredients, creating a formula designed to provide both beneficial microorganisms and nutritional support for gut bacteria. However, it is important to keep expectations realistic: evidence for individual probiotic strains does not automatically prove that a finished supplement will cause weight loss or produce a specific health outcome. The product should therefore be considered supportive nutrition, not a treatment.</div><div><br></div><div>Finally, SodaTide is intended to work best as part of a consistent lifestyle. A capsule cannot replace a balanced diet, movement, hydration, sleep, or appropriate medical care. Its role is to provide additional nutritional support for the gut and digestive system. The official product information recommends one capsule daily with an 8-ounce glass of water, preferably before a meal. Because probiotics can be sensitive to storage conditions, the manufacturer also recommends refrigeration after opening to help preserve probiotic potency.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
