        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthy Weight-Management Goals: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">SodaTide is designed to complement healthy weight-management efforts through a gut-focused nutritional approach. Its combination of prebiotic fiber, resistant starch, and probiotics supports the digestive environment rather than depending on strong stimulants. Maintaining a healthy weight still depends primarily on overall calorie intake, nutrition, physical activity, sleep, and other lifestyle factors. SodaTide can be included as part of that routine to provide additional nutritional support. It should not be presented as a guaranteed fat-burning or weight-loss solution. Instead, its purpose is to support the systems involved in normal digestion and metabolic wellness while a person follows sustainable healthy habits.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Digestive Wellness:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"> Digestive wellness is another important focus of SodaTide. Chicory Root Inulin provides prebiotic fiber, while resistant starch offers another source of nourishment for gut microorganisms. The probiotic blend adds beneficial microorganisms to the formula. Together, these ingredients are designed to support a balanced intestinal environment and normal digestive function. A healthy digestive routine can also benefit from adequate dietary fiber, water, regular movement, and a varied diet. SodaTide is therefore best considered an addition to an overall digestive-health routine rather than a standalone solution for persistent digestive problems.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Helps Support A Balanced Gut Microbiome: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">The gut microbiome contains a large community of microorganisms that interact with the digestive environment. SodaTide is formulated around supporting this ecosystem using both prebiotic and probiotic components. Chicory Root Inulin and Potato Resistant Starch can provide substrates that certain gut microorganisms can utilize, while the probiotic blend contributes additional beneficial microorganisms. Maintaining a balanced microbiome is an important part of digestive wellness. However, everyone's microbiome is different, so responses to prebiotic and probiotic ingredients can vary. A balanced diet containing naturally fiber-rich foods can also play an important role in supporting healthy gut bacteria.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Normal Metabolic Wellness: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">SodaTide is also positioned as a supplement for metabolic wellness. The connection between digestion, gut microorganisms, and normal metabolic processes has become an important area of nutritional research. By supporting the gut environment with prebiotic fiber, resistant starch, and probiotics, SodaTide is designed to complement normal metabolic function. This does not mean the supplement directly treats metabolic disorders or guarantees changes in blood sugar, body fat, or metabolism. Instead, it provides nutritional ingredients that support a healthy digestive environment as part of a broader lifestyle that includes nutritious food choices and regular physical activity.</span></li><li><b>Convenient Daily Gut-Health Support: </b>One practical benefit of SodaTide is its simple daily format. Instead of requiring multiple powders, drinks, or complicated preparation steps, the product is designed around a daily capsule. The listed routine is one capsule with an 8-ounce glass of water, preferably in the morning before a meal. This makes it easy to incorporate into an established morning routine. Consistency can be useful when taking dietary supplements, although users should always follow the current product label rather than exceeding the recommended serving.</li><li><b>Better Nutrient Absorption: </b>A healthier gut can help the body break down and absorb nutrients more efficiently, supporting daily energy and overall wellness.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
